+b}c\\right\\rfloor\\le\\left\\lfloor\\dfrac{dx+e}f\\right\\rfloor\\right]\\cdot\\left\\lfloor\\dfrac{ax+b}c\\right\\rfloor$$\nTake the answer modulo $10^9+3579$.","formatI":"The first line contains a positive integer $T$, the number of test cases.\n\nThe next $T$ lines each contain seven positive integers $a, b, c, d, e, f, n$, describing one query.","formatO":"Output $T$ lines. Each line is the answer for one query, modulo $10^9+3579$.","hint":"**This problem uses bundled tests.** Subtasks are as follows:\n- Subtask 1 (10 pts): $n, T \\le 1000$.\n- Subtask 2 (20 pts): $c = 1$.\n- Subtask 3 (70 pts): No special constraints.\n\nConstraints for all testdata: $1 \\le T \\le 10^5$, $1 \\le a, b, c, d, e, f, n \\le 10^9$.\n\nNote: The input file is large, so please pay attention to I\/O efficiency.\n\nTranslated by ChatGPT 5","locale":"en"},"zh-CN":{"name":"\u300eSTA - R10\u300f\u96e8\u843d\u73ab\u7470","background":"","description":"\u591a\u7ec4\u6570\u636e\uff0c\u6bcf\u6b21\u7ed9\u5b9a\u6b63\u6574\u6570 $a,b,c,d,e,f,n$\uff0c\u4f60\u9700\u8981\u6c42\u4e0b\u5f0f\u7684\u503c\uff1a\n$$\\sum_{x=1}^n\\left[\\left\\lfloor\\dfrac{ax+b}c\\right\\rfloor\\le\\left\\lfloor\\dfrac{dx+e}f\\right\\rfloor\\right]\\cdot\\left\\lfloor\\dfrac{ax+b}c\\right\\rfloor$$\n\u7b54\u6848\u5bf9 $10^9+3579$ \u53d6\u6a21\u3002","formatI":"\u7b2c\u4e00\u884c\u4e00\u4e2a\u6b63\u6574\u6570 $T$ \u8868\u793a\u6570\u636e\u7ec4\u6570\u3002\n\n\u540e $T$ \u884c\uff0c\u6bcf\u884c\u4e03\u4e2a\u6b63\u6574\u6570 $a,b,c,d,e,f,n$ \u63cf\u8ff0\u4e00\u7ec4\u8be2\u95ee\u3002","formatO":"$T$ \u884c\uff0c\u6bcf\u884c\u56de\u7b54\u4e00\u7ec4\u8be2\u95ee\uff0c\u5bf9 $10^9+3579$ \u53d6\u6a21\u3002","hint":"**\u672c\u9898\u91c7\u7528\u6346\u7ed1\u6d4b\u8bd5\u3002**[]()Subtask \u5206\u5e03\u5982\u4e0b\uff1a\n- Subtask 1 (10pts)\uff1a$n,T\\le 1000$\u3002\n- Subtask 2 (20pts)\uff1a$c=1$\u3002\n- Subtask 3 (70pts)\uff1a\u65e0\u7279\u6b8a\u9650\u5236\u3002\n\n\u5bf9\u4e8e\u5168\u90e8\u6570\u636e\uff0c$1\\le T\\le 10^5$\uff0c